{"status":"completed","summary":"node1 now has a persistent firewalld policy permitting SSH and TCP/8080 while explicitly rejecting unrelated inbound connections. The policy survived a verified node reboot.","actions_performed":["Removed Cockpit and DHCPv6-client exposure from the public zone.","Enabled SSH and TCP/8080 with the zone target set to REJECT.","Behaviorally tested TCP/22, TCP/8080, and unrelated TCP/9090 before and after reboot.","Rebooted node1 safely and confirmed its boot identity changed.","Removed all temporary test listeners and network namespaces."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Persistent firewall permits only SSH and TCP/8080 with an explicit rejection fallback","command_ids":["cmd-030fdb933c074af6","cmd-d4233367c0374f7c","cmd-55ca7bb501d24cdc"],"summary":"Runtime and permanent public-zone configuration contains SSH and 8080/tcp with target REJECT; firewalld is active and enabled."},{"requirement":"Inbound SSH and TCP/8080 are allowed while unrelated inbound TCP is rejected","command_ids":["cmd-8fbe868ad3704576","cmd-f41bb0c2cc42499a","cmd-b8ca161a144a4a82","cmd-26c819d797e649cb"],"summary":"With live listeners present, isolated inbound probes connected to TCP/22 and TCP/8080, while TCP/9090 was rejected both before and after reboot."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-9a70139da32142c3","cmd-0c6a1545819c4461","cmd-1cde0022cce24597","cmd-872230d7f9434483","cmd-26c819d797e649cb"],"summary":"The healthy pre-restart boot ID was fbdf5b2c-bb43-49f6-935d-fb98f8a972f6; the reboot was acknowledged; the recovered boot ID was 6336d797-27b6-427b-ac4b-019ad8304c88. Firewalld, sshd, the persisted policy, and expected filtering behavior all recovered."},{"requirement":"Temporary verification resources removed","command_ids":["cmd-55ca7bb501d24cdc"],"summary":"No probe namespaces or temporary TCP/8080 or TCP/9090 listeners remain; only enp1s0 is assigned to the active public zone."}]}
